## Fully declarative version of wave_4.ani: instead of 46 hand-written bitmap
## frames, the whole wave is one named-crest profile that is scrolled with a
## single swept insert.
##
## One spatial period (46 tubes), composed from the crest segments in waves.alib
## with b0 troughs between. Peaks: 1,3,2,4,2,1,4,2,1.

title|Waves
import|waves.alib
scale|0.12
loop|forever

## Scroll a doubled copy of the profile one tube per frame for a full period.
## The window stays 92 tubes wide until the file finishes loading, so each step's
## shifted-off tubes wrap in from the second copy before the final crop to 16.
## reverse=true makes the sweep scroll right, matching wave_4.ani (seamless-
## identical; the loop is offset by one frame, which is invisible while looping).
sequence|start|wave_window
frame|1|{wave_profile}{wave_profile}
sequence|end
sequence|insert|wave_window|repeat=46|shift_step=-1|reverse=true
